Package: gigmath
Type: Package
Title: True Hourly Rate for Gig-Work Offers After Fees and Unpaid Time
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3@gmail.com>
Description: The payout a gig app quotes divides by on-task time only; the
    waiting, the empty drive back, and the invoicing never make that number.
    gigmath() recomputes an offer the way the week actually plays out:
    platform fee, mileage at your real cost per mile, a self-employment
    tax estimate, and every unpaid minute added to the clock. Flags offers
    below your floor, losing money outright, hiding 40%+ of their time
    unpaid, or paying under half the headline rate. Companion to the
    receipts-first gig math on ExtraHustles <https://extrahustles.com>.
